---
layout: layouts/base.njk
---

<!-- State Hero Section -->
<section class="hero">
  <div class="container hero-grid">
    <div class="hero-content">
      <!-- Badges Top (Matching furnace repair pros) -->
      <div class="hero-badges-top">
        <span class="hero-pill-active"><span class="badge-dot"></span> Priority Roofing Network Active</span>
        <span class="hero-pill-fast">
          <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><polygon points="13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2"></polygon></svg>
          FAST ROOFING SERVICE IN {{ state.name | upper }}
        </span>
      </div>

      <h1>Shingle Roof Installation in {{ state.name }}</h1>

      <!-- Rich Niche Paragraph (Matching furnace repair pros depth) -->
      <p class="hero-lead">
        American Shingle Co. connects homeowners across {{ state.name }} with licensed and insured roofing specialists equipped to handle complete tear-offs, underlayment upgrades, deck structural inspections, and precision shingle installations. We provide rapid statewide contractor dispatch with typical partner response times of 30 to 90 minutes &mdash; ensuring {{ state.buildingCode }} compliance, Class 4 impact options for regional weather resilience, and long-lasting manufacturer warranties.
      </p>

      <div class="hero-trust-pills">
        <span class="trust-pill"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"></polyline></svg> Code: {{ state.buildingCode }}</span>
        <span class="trust-pill"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M13 2L3 14h9l-1 8 10-12h-9l1-8z"></path></svg> Hail Risk: {{ state.hailRisk }}</span>
      </div>

      <!-- Action Buttons (Matching furnace repair pros) -->
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a href="tel:{{ site.phoneTel }}" class="hero-call-btn" id="hero-call-btn">
          <div class="hero-call-icon">
            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M6.62 10.79a15.053 15.053 0 006.59 6.59l2.2-2.2c.27-.27.67-.36 1.02-.24 1.12.37 2.33.57 3.57.57.55 0 1 .45 1 1V20c0 .55-.45 1-1 1-9.39 0-17-7.61-17-17 0-.55.45-1 1-1h3.5c.55 0 1 .45 1 1 0 1.25.2 2.45.57 3.57.11.35.03.74-.25 1.02l-2.2 2.2z"></path></svg>
          </div>
          <div class="hero-call-text">
            <span class="hero-call-label">Call 24/7 Service</span>
            <span class="hero-call-number">{{ site.phoneDisplay }}</span>
          </div>
        </a>
        <a href="#state-city-filter" class="hero-secondary-btn" id="hero-cities-btn">
          <span>Explore Cities</span>
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"></polyline></svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div>
      <div class="hero-img-wrapper" style="position: relative;">
        <img src="/assets/images/hero_roofing.jpg" alt="Professional roofing contractors in {{ state.name }}" class="hero-main-img" width="900" height="650">
        <div class="hero-img-badge">
          <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><polygon points="13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2"></polygon></svg>
          <span>Response Time: 30 to 90 Mins</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Stats Ribbon below Hero (Matching furnace repair pros) -->
<div class="hero-stats-strip">
  <div class="container hero-stats-grid">
    <div class="hero-stat-item">
      <span class="hero-stat-value">30 to 90 Min</span>
      <span class="hero-stat-label">Average Partner Response</span>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-stat-item">
      <span class="hero-stat-value">Licensed &amp; Insured</span>
      <span class="hero-stat-label">Independent Contractors</span>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-stat-item">
      <span class="hero-stat-value">All 7 Materials</span>
      <span class="hero-stat-label">Asphalt, Metal, Slate &amp; More</span>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-stat-item">
      <span class="hero-stat-value">Code Compliance</span>
      <span class="hero-stat-label">{{ state.buildingCode }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- Main State Content -->
<section style="padding: 3.5rem 0;">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 900px;">
    
    <!-- State Snapshot Card -->
    <div class="direct-answer">
      <strong>{{ state.name }} Roofing Snapshot:</strong> Residential roofing in {{ state.name }} must withstand local weather stresses characterized by {{ state.climate | lower }} Contractors in our network comply with {{ state.buildingCode }} and {{ state.licensing }}
    </div>

    <h2>{{ state.name }} Climate Hazards & Storm Durability</h2>
    <p>
      Selecting the correct shingle material and fastening schedule depends heavily on {{ state.name }}'s prevailing weather patterns:
    </p>

    <div class="table-responsive">
      <table>
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>Climate & Storm Factor</th>
            <th>Regional Profile & Recommended Shingle Defense</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <td><strong>Climate Overview</strong></td>
            <td>{{ state.climate }}</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><strong>Hail Exposure Risk</strong></td>
            <td><strong>{{ state.hailRisk }}</strong> — In moderate to extreme zones, UL 2218 Class 4 impact shingles are recommended.</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><strong>Wind Velocity Risk</strong></td>
            <td><strong>{{ state.windRisk }}</strong> — Requires ASTM D7158 Class H wind-rated shingles with enhanced 6-nail patterns.</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><strong>Freeze-Thaw Cycling</strong></td>
            <td><strong>{{ state.freezeThaw }}</strong> — Ice barrier self-adhering membranes required along eaves in freeze zones.</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><strong>Licensing Authority</strong></td>
            <td>{{ state.licensing }}</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><strong>Adopted Building Code</strong></td>
            <td>{{ state.buildingCode }}</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><strong>Local Permitting Notes</strong></td>
            <td>{{ state.permitNote }}</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>

    <!-- 7 Materials Suitability in this State -->
    <h2>Recommended Shingle Materials for {{ state.name }} Homes</h2>
    <p>
      Our network of independent contractors installs and replaces all seven major shingle roofing systems across {{ state.name }}:
    </p>

    <div class="services-grid" style="grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 1.25rem; margin: 1.5rem 0 2.5rem 0;">
      {% for s in services %}
      <div class="service-card">
        <div class="service-card-img-wrapper">
          <img src="{{ s.image }}" alt="{{ s.name }} in {{ state.name }}" loading="lazy" width="400" height="250" class="service-card-img">
        </div>
        <div class="service-card-body">
          <h3 style="margin: 0 0 0.5rem 0;"><a href="/services/{{ s.slug }}/">{{ s.name }}</a></h3>
          <p style="font-size: 0.92rem; margin: 0.5rem 0;">{{ s.shortDescription }}</p>
          <div style="display: flex; gap: 1rem; font-size: 0.82rem; color: var(--color-text-muted); margin-top: auto;">
            <span><strong>Lifespan:</strong> {{ s.lifespan }}</span>
            <span><strong>Impact:</strong> {{ s.impactRating }}</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>

    <!-- Regional Cost Guidance -->
    <div class="callout-box callout-box-accent">
      <h3>{{ state.name }} Roofing Cost Expectations</h3>
      <p>
        The regional labor and material cost index for {{ state.name }} is calculated at <strong>{{ state.costIndex }}x</strong> the national baseline average. For a typical 2,000 square foot home, an architectural asphalt shingle roof installation generally ranges from <strong>${{ (8200 * state.costIndex) | round }} to ${{ (13800 * state.costIndex) | round }}</strong> depending on roof pitch and tear-off layers.
      </p>
      <a href="/roofing-costs/shingle-roof-cost-by-state/" class="btn btn-primary" style="margin-top: 0.5rem;">
        View 51-State Roofing Cost Comparison
      </a>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<!-- Why Choose Us Section (Matching furnacerepairpros.com) -->
<section class="section why-section" id="why-us">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="text-center" style="text-align: center; max-width: 680px; margin: 0 auto;">
      <span class="badge">
        <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"></path></svg>
        Why Choose Us
      </span>
      <h2 style="margin-top: 0.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">Why {{ state.name }} Homeowners Call {{ site.name }}</h2>
      <p style="color: var(--color-text-muted); margin: 0 auto; line-height: 1.6;">
        When storms, aging decks, or roofing projects arise in {{ state.name }}, here is why local residents rely on {{ site.name }} for safe, dependable shingle installation.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="why-grid">
      <div class="why-card">
        <div class="why-icon-box">
          <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 2a10 10 0 1 0 10 10A10 10 0 0 0 12 2zm1 14.59-3.3-3.3a1 1 0 0 1 1.42-1.42L13 13.76l4.88-4.88a1 1 0 0 1 1.42 1.42z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3>24/7 Rapid Contractor Dispatch</h3>
          <p>Severe weather and leak emergencies happen without warning. Our contractor network is operational 24/7, 365 days a year, responding promptly within 30 to 90 minutes when you need structural protection most.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="why-card">
        <div class="why-icon-box">
          <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M21.41 11.58l-9-9A2 2 0 0 0 11 2H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v7a2 2 0 0 0 .59 1.42l9 9A2 2 0 0 0 13 22a2 2 0 0 0 1.41-.59l7-7a2 2 0 0 0 0-2.83zM6.5 8A1.5 1.5 0 1 1 8 6.5 1.5 1.5 0 0 1 6.5 8z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3>Upfront Itemized Pricing</h3>
          <p>You receive a complete deck diagnostic inspection and an upfront, itemized quote before any tear-off or installation begins. The price you approve is the price you pay &mdash; with zero hidden fees.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="why-card">
        <div class="why-icon-box">
          <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 3L1 9l11 6 9-4.91V17h2V9L12 3zm0 8.87L4.72 9 12 5.05 19.28 9 12 11.87zM5 13.18v4L12 21l7-3.82v-4L12 17l-7-3.82z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3>All Major Shingle Brands</h3>
          <p>Our contractor partners install certified architectural, 3-tab, metal, and composite systems from GAF, CertainTeed, Owens Corning, Atlas, and Tamko according to strict manufacturer specs.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="why-card">
        <div class="why-icon-box">
          <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 1L3 5v6c0 5.55 3.84 10.74 9 12 5.16-1.26 9-6.45 9-12V5l-9-4zm-2 16l-4-4 1.41-1.41L10 14.17l6.59-6.59L18 9l-8 8z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3>Rigorous Safety &amp; Deck Checks</h3>
          <p>Roof structural integrity is paramount. Every installation includes comprehensive checks on deck plywood deflection, drip edge compliance, valley ice barriers, and proper attic intake/exhaust venting.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="why-card">
        <div class="why-icon-box">
          <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M20 8h-3V4H3c-1.1 0-2 .9-2 2v11h2c0 1.66 1.34 3 3 3s3-1.34 3-3h6c0 1.66 1.34 3 3 3s3-1.34 3-3h2v-5l-3-4zM6 18.5c-.83 0-1.5-.67-1.5-1.5s.67-1.5 1.5-1.5 1.5.67 1.5 1.5-.67 1.5-1.5 1.5zm13.5-9l1.96 2.5H17V9.5h2.5zm-1.5 9c-.83 0-1.5-.67-1.5-1.5s.67-1.5 1.5-1.5 1.5.67 1.5 1.5-.67 1.5-1.5 1.5z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3>Fully Equipped Service Crews</h3>
          <p>Specialists arrive equipped with complete tear-off gear, magnetic nail sweeps, pneumatic coil nailers, and heavy-duty synthetic underlayment for fast, single-visit dried-in protection.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="why-card">
        <div class="why-icon-box">
          <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3>Licensed &amp; Insured Specialists</h3>
          <p>Our referral network consists of independent, verified, and insured roofing contractors who know {{ state.name }} building codes ({{ state.buildingCode }}) and regional climate challenges inside and out.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Communities & Cities Section -->
<section style="padding: 3.5rem 0; background: #ffffff;">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 900px;">
    <!-- City Directory Section -->
    <h2>Communities & Cities Served in {{ state.name }}</h2>
    <p>
      American Shingle Co. provides licensed and insured roofing contractor connections across {{ state.name }}. Select your city or town below to check local contractor availability, permit guidelines, and get an estimate:
    </p>

    {% set stateCities = locations[state.slug] %}
    {% if not stateCities or stateCities.length == 0 %}
      {% set stateCities = cities | filterByState(state.slug) %}
    {% endif %}

    {% if stateCities and stateCities.length > 0 %}
    <div style="margin: 1.5rem 0 1rem 0;">
      <input type="text" id="state-city-filter" placeholder="Filter {{ state.name }} cities..." style="width: 100%; max-width: 420px; padding: 0.75rem 1rem; border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-radius: var(--radius-sm); font-size: 0.95rem;" onkeyup="filterStateCities()">
      <span style="display: block; font-size: 0.82rem; color: var(--color-text-muted); margin-top: 0.4rem;">
        Showing all {{ stateCities.length }} covered municipalities in {{ state.name }}.
      </span>
    </div>

    <div class="state-grid" id="state-cities-grid" style="grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(180px, 1fr)); max-height: 520px; overflow-y: auto; padding: 1.25rem; background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-radius: var(--radius-md); box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);">
      {% for c in stateCities %}
      <a href="/{{ state.slug }}/{{ c.slug }}/" class="state-link city-link-item" data-name="{{ c.name | lower }}" style="padding: 0.55rem 0.85rem; font-size: 0.92rem;">
        <span>{{ c.name }}</span>
      </a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>

    <script>
      function filterStateCities() {
        var q = document.getElementById('state-city-filter').value.toLowerCase().trim();
        var links = document.querySelectorAll('#state-cities-grid .city-link-item');
        links.forEach(function(l) {
          var name = l.getAttribute('data-name') || '';
          l.style.display = (q === '' || name.includes(q)) ? 'flex' : 'none';
        });
      }
    </script>
    {% else %}
    <p style="background: #ffffff; padding: 1.5rem; border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-radius: var(--radius-md);">
      Serving all municipalities, counties, and unincorporated areas across {{ state.name }}. Call <a href="tel:{{ site.phoneTel }}"><strong>{{ site.phoneDisplay }}</strong></a> to be connected with a certified contractor serving your specific ZIP code.
    </p>
    {% endif %}

  </div>
</section>

<!-- Our Commitment Section (Matching furnacerepairpros.com) -->
<section class="section commitment-section" id="our-commitment">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="text-center" style="text-align: center; max-width: 680px; margin: 0 auto;">
      <span class="badge">
        <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"></circle><path d="M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"></path><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"></path></svg>
        Our Commitment
      </span>
      <h2 style="margin-top: 0.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">Our Commitment to Every {{ state.name }} Homeowner</h2>
      <p style="color: var(--color-text-muted); margin: 0 auto; line-height: 1.6;">
        We believe in honest assessments, respectful customer service, and transparent pricing. Here is what you can depend on every time an independent roofing specialist arrives at your {{ state.name }} home.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="commitment-grid">
      <div class="commitment-card">
        <div class="commitment-icon-box">
          <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 2C6.5 2 2 6.5 2 12s4.5 10 10 10 10-4.5 10-10S17.5 2 12 2zm4.2 14.2L11 13V7h1.5v5.2l4.5 2.7-.8 1.3z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3>Prompt Response &amp; Clear Arrival Windows</h3>
          <p>We respect your schedule in {{ state.name }}. Our intake coordinators route your project directly to verified local roofing specialists with confirmed 30 to 90 minute average response times.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="commitment-card">
        <div class="commitment-icon-box">
          <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M15.5 14h-.79l-.28-.27A6.471 6.471 0 0 0 16 9.5 6.5 6.5 0 1 0 9.5 16c1.61 0 3.09-.59 4.23-1.57l.27.28v.79l5 4.99L20.49 19l-4.99-5zm-6 0C7.01 14 5 11.99 5 9.5S7.01 5 9.5 5 14 7.01 14 9.5 11.99 14 9.5 14z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3>Detailed Roof &amp; Deck Walkthrough</h3>
          <p>Before any work begins, your roofing contractor conducts an exhaustive on-site evaluation of roof decking, pitch, flashing, valleys, and ventilation, explaining every detail in plain English.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="commitment-card">
        <div class="commitment-icon-box">
          <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M11.8 10.9c-2.27-.59-3-1.2-3-2.15 0-1.09 1.01-1.85 2.7-1.85 1.78 0 2.44.85 2.5 2.1h2.21c-.07-1.72-1.12-3.3-3.21-3.81V3h-3v2.16c-1.94.42-3.5 1.68-3.5 3.61 0 2.31 1.91 3.46 4.7 4.13 2.5.6 3 1.48 3 2.41 0 .69-.49 1.79-2.7 1.79-2.06 0-2.87-.92-2.98-2.1h-2.2c.12 2.19 1.76 3.42 3.68 3.83V21h3v-2.15c1.95-.37 3.5-1.5 3.5-3.55 0-2.84-2.43-3.81-4.7-4.4z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3>Firm Upfront Pricing Guarantee</h3>
          <p>No hidden surprise costs or confusing contractor bids. You receive an itemized written estimate detailing squares, materials, underlayment, and labor before tear-off starts.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="commitment-card">
        <div class="commitment-icon-box">
          <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 1L3 5v6c0 5.55 3.84 10.74 9 12 5.16-1.26 9-6.45 9-12V5l-9-4zm-2 16l-4-4 1.41-1.41L10 14.17l6.59-6.59L18 9l-8 8z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3>Rigorous Safety &amp; Deck Checks</h3>
          <p>Your home's structural safety is non-negotiable. Every roof installation concludes with strict deck fastening checks, magnetic nail sweeps across the entire perimeter, and cleanup.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- State FAQs & CTA -->
<section style="padding: 3.5rem 0;">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 900px;">
    <!-- State FAQs -->
    <h2>{{ state.name }} Roofing Questions</h2>
    <div class="faq-list">
      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary class="faq-summary">Do roofing contractors in {{ state.name }} need to be licensed?</summary>
        <div class="faq-content">
          <p>{{ state.licensing }} All independent contractors in the American Shingle Co. network must verify compliance with applicable state and local jurisdiction licensing and insurance requirements.</p>
        </div>
      </details>
      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary class="faq-summary">Are building permits required for roof replacement in {{ state.name }}?</summary>
        <div class="faq-content">
          <p>{{ state.permitNote }} In virtually all incorporated areas, a building permit must be obtained prior to initiating a complete roof tear-off and replacement.</p>
        </div>
      </details>
      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary class="faq-summary">What is the best shingle material for homes in {{ state.name }}?</summary>
        <div class="faq-content">
          <p>For most {{ state.name }} homeowners, architectural asphalt shingles provide the best balance of value, Class A fire protection, and 130 mph wind defense. In areas with {{ state.hailRisk | lower }} hail exposure, Class 4 impact-resistant stone-coated metal or recycled rubber shingles provide maximum longevity.</p>
        </div>
      </details>
    </div>

    <!-- Final CTA Box -->
    <div style="background: var(--color-primary); color: #ffffff; padding: 2.5rem; border-radius: var(--radius-lg); text-align: center; margin-top: 3rem;">
      <h2 style="color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0;">Need Shingle Installation in {{ state.name }}?</h2>
      <p style="color: #cbd5e1; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto 1.5rem auto;">
        Connect with licensed and insured local roofing professionals. Phone intake available 7 days a week, with average partner response time in {{ site.responseTime }}.
      </p>
      <div style="display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 1rem; flex-wrap: wrap;">
        <a href="tel:{{ site.phoneTel }}" class="btn btn-primary" id="state-call-cta">
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M6.62 10.79a15.053 15.053 0 006.59 6.59l2.2-2.2c.27-.27.67-.36 1.02-.24 1.12.37 2.33.57 3.57.57.55 0 1 .45 1 1V20c0 .55-.45 1-1 1-9.39 0-17-7.61-17-17 0-.55.45-1 1-1h3.5c.55 0 1 .45 1 1 0 1.25.2 2.45.57 3.57.11.35.03.74-.25 1.02l-2.2 2.2z"/></svg>
          Call Now: {{ site.phoneDisplay }}
        </a>
        <a href="#state-city-filter" class="btn btn-secondary">
          Find Your City &rarr;
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
